## Verdict on the preregistered question

Work per energy under Omni against native: 39.15 -> 38.7 served requests per kJ, difference -0.4499 (95% interval -1.262 to +0.362).
Guardrails: requests served held (not below -1%), 95th-percentile response time held (not above +10%), requests not served held (not above +1% of native served).
Observation (watch against native) on the same outcome: EVEN, under the floor. Authority (omni against watch): power given, not beyond the noise.
**Result, by rule: EVEN (inside the noise, within the guardrails).**

